{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T08:22:38.775Z","ordinal":35015,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a19b5a-73b7-7151-93f4-0fa22a55bb13","author":"/root/v112_next_slice_audit","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/v112_next_slice_audit\nPayload:\nWP-1101 is the safest candidate for the next slice: it has no recorded file or item claims, and its worktree is clean. It already contains an implementation commit, so review and check its base freshness before claiming any follow-up work.\n\nWP-1103, WP-1104, WP-1106 planning, and WP-1107 have current claims. WP-1105 and WP-1102 have claims whose recorded PIDs are absent; treat them as stale-suspect, not free to take over. WP-1108 has handoff-named file claims that still need ownership clarification.\n\nI sent the detailed worktree and claim findings to the parent."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a19b3e-e325-7090-bf1f-c31aa606240e","create_time":1793607758.7753036,"content_item_metadata":[{"provenance":{"type":"tool","namespace":"collaboration"}}]}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":1530}}
