{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T09:28:51.165Z","ordinal":36852,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a19b97-10dc-72c3-806e-1885603026a3","author":"/root/roadmap_status_audit","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/roadmap_status_audit\nPayload:\nAs of 09:27Z, the final suite is still running under the root’s active `SUITE` claim. WP-1103/1104 have review approval per the parent’s update, and six-task acceptance evidence is present, but exact source-commit linkage from the package archive still needs confirmation. The final suite result remains pending.\n\nI found no ready, safely claimable implementation slice. WP-1102 and WP-1105 owners are not reachable through the configured agent directory; their handoff requests remain unresolved, and their worktrees contain files that must be preserved. I sent the refreshed WP-by-WP status and claim details to the parent."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a19b3e-e325-7090-bf1f-c31aa606240e","create_time":1793611731.164939,"content_item_metadata":[{"provenance":{"type":"tool","namespace":"collaboration"}}]}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":1555}}
