{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T09:53:40.594Z","ordinal":37542,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_01a19bad-caf2-7fb1-8ff3-db2980a709be","call_id":"call_984072c4afb14636abcb8393597fd05e","output":"{\"agents\":[{\"agent_name\":\"/root\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/roadmap_status_audit\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"As of 09:27Z, the final suite is still running under the root’s active `SUITE` claim. WP-1103/1104 have review approval per the parent’s update, and six-task acceptance evidence is present, but exact source-commit linkage from the package archive still needs confirmation. The final suite result remains pending.\\n\\nI found no ready, safely claimable implementation slice. WP-1102 and WP-1105 owners are not reachable through the configured agent directory; their handoff requests remain unresolved, and their worktrees contain files that must be preserved. I sent the refreshed WP-by-WP status and claim details to the parent.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/v112_next_slice_audit\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"WP-1101 has no recorded owner or heartbeat, but its clean branch is 43 commits behind the current integration branch. The roadmap remains “Draft / Active Planning,” and the spec says “Proposed / Specification”; neither records WP-1101 as done.\\n\\nThe existing commit adds a recorder foundation, but nothing calls it from agent, inference, tool, or compaction flows, so G1.1-1 remains unmet. I sent the detailed audit and recommended a fresh, claimed integration slice with a reviewed spec and plan.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/v112_release_publication_audit\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"**v1.1.2 is not tagged or published.** GitHub lists v1.1.1 as latest, `gh release view v1.1.2` returns “release not found,” and neither local Git nor `origin` has a `v1.1.2*` tag.\\n\\nThe release scope is inconsistent with the requested roadmap. The integration worktree’s [v1.1.2 release notes](/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1104-integration/docs/releases/v1.1.2.md) define a one-fix patch that inherits v1.1.1 qualification. The [v1.1.0 roadmap](/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1104-integration/docs/v1.1.0/ROADMAP.md) defines WP-1101 through WP-1108 and five release gates; its README explicitly says those roadmap packages are not implemented in the described release. Branch CI successes do not qualify an integrated exact head, and the current WP-1103/1104 package was built from a dirty candidate, so it is not exact-commit release evidence.\\n\\nI sent the audit and recommended next steps to the parent agent. No tags, releases, or files were changed.\"}}]}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a19b9f-f23a-70e0-bbf9-0adf509bb26d","create_time":1793613220.5944743}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
