{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T10:05:55.108Z","ordinal":37935,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a192c0-f277-7f60-8574-21ce71edb8c2","turn_id":"01a19b9f-f23a-70e0-bbf9-0adf509bb26d","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0fd4138577b17921016ae8608227a881a38144c6dc9156830f","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The suite gate and build gate are green, and the approved code/evidence change is committed as `05c49df2`. The WP-1103 dataset umbrella still has untracked work in its own worktree, so I’m keeping those shared claims intact. I’ll record the WP-1104 commit, evidence hash, and review verdict in its tracker, then release only the WP-1104-specific file claims. v1.1.2 itself remains unreleased and its broader roadmap work remains open."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793613954172,"completed_at_ms":1793613955108}}
