{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T10:08:32.407Z","ordinal":38083,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a19bbb-6697-7ea2-b42b-7cd69af2df1a","author":"/root/roadmap_status_audit","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/roadmap_status_audit\nPayload:\nThe suite process has exited, and its log shows 2,138 tests: 2,136 passed, 0 failed, 2 skipped; the process-scope check passed. The retention group took about 11 minutes. I can confirm the D-state ended with process completion, but not its cause.\n\nWP-1104 is committed and independently approved. Its closeout explicitly limits completion to WP-1103/1104 source and acceptance work, not full-roadmap release qualification. I found no next implementation slice that is both ready and safe to claim: WP-1101 and WP-1106 need files still claimed by PR396; WP-1102/1105 handoffs remain unresolved; WP-1107 is claimed; WP-1108 spans shared infrastructure. I sent the refreshed state and evidence details to the parent."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a19b9f-f23a-70e0-bbf9-0adf509bb26d","create_time":1793614112.4074657,"content_item_metadata":[{"provenance":{"type":"tool","namespace":"collaboration"}}]}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":1594}}
