{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T10:16:49.866Z","ordinal":38424,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a192c0-f277-7f60-8574-21ce71edb8c2","turn_id":"01a19b9f-f23a-70e0-bbf9-0adf509bb26d","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-2fa12e52-e9da-44e9-9326-8e2dd98497f7","server":"mcp-search","tool":"work_state_write","arguments":{"list":"v1.1.2-release","fields":{"phase":"PLAN","gate":"WP-1103 AC2 focused test passes 3/3; added dataset-specific actual mount-view assertions and documented plan addendum; waiting for peer plan-review before further edits or full integration gate","next":"Receive plan review for AC2 addendum, then run full suite on the new test change, review the resulting commit, and close or continue WP-1103 based on AC coverage.","friction":"WP-1103 earlier review identified AC2 lacked dataset-specific absolute-path/mount-view proof; supplemental test now verifies /workspace mount present, dataset root absent, and absolute hidden validator unreadable. WP-1103 claim ownership metadata still references old runner-reclaim worktree; reconcile before closure.","updated":"2026-11-02T10:17:00Z"}},"pluginId":"claude-mem@claude-mem-local","status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Saved to \"v1.1.2-release\" in nexus-code. Still open in it:\n- v1.1.2-release: state=WP-1104 standalone eval slice is closed with commits 05c49df2 and 2a94f62e, final full suite/build green, peer review approved, and WP-1104-only claims released. Full v1.1.2 roadmap/release remains active., phase=PLAN, gate=WP-1103 AC2 focused test passes 3/3; added dataset-specific actual mount-view assertions and documented plan addendum; waiting for peer plan-review before further edits or full integration gate, next=Receive plan review for AC2 addendum, then run full suite on the new test change, review the resulting commit, and close or continue WP-1103 based on AC coverage., friction=WP-1103 earlier review identified AC2 lacked dataset-specific absolute-