{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T10:17:47.780Z","ordinal":38445,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a19bc3-e003-74e1-9f45-1dd6c21474f4","author":"/root/review_delta","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/review_delta\nPayload:\n**APPROVED.** The AC2 addendum is testable and bounded to the existing dataset-isolation test. Its assertions observe the candidate’s `/workspace` mount, absence of the dataset staging root from mountinfo, and unreadability of the absolute validator path, while retaining the staged-tree and sentinel checks ([test](/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1104-integration/cli/test/eval_dataset.test.ts:87), [addendum](/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1104-integration/docs/v1.1.0/WP-1103-ORACLE-ISOLATION.md:39)).\n\nThe references fit: they point to the real sandbox probe and `run_command` wrapper, with the evaluator’s `/tmp` and `/workspace` mounts identified through local source inspection. Both changed files have active claims on this worktree. The documented focused pass is evidence for this change; full integration gates remain separate."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a19b9f-f23a-70e0-bbf9-0adf509bb26d","create_time":1793614667.7793357,"content_item_metadata":[{"provenance":{"type":"tool","namespace":"collaboration"}}]}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":1611}}
