{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T10:32:58.063Z","ordinal":38825,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a192c0-f277-7f60-8574-21ce71edb8c2","turn_id":"01a19b9f-f23a-70e0-bbf9-0adf509bb26d","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-d907e9f4-237e-432f-8bf0-d3b9d82a2778","server":"mcp-search","tool":"work_state_read","arguments":{"list":"v1.1.2-release","includeClosed":true},"pluginId":"claude-mem@claude-mem-local","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"- v1.1.2-release: state=WP-1104 standalone eval slice is closed with commits 05c49df2 and 2a94f62e, final full suite/build green, peer review approved, and WP-1104-only claims released. Full v1.1.2 roadmap/release remains active., phase=GREEN, gate=WP-1103 AC2 focused dataset test PASS (3/3); fresh full npm test plus process-scope postcheck running in suite snapshot under SUITE claim; new unique candidate evidence path claimed, next=Monitor run 8783 to completion, verify full suite totals, scope postcheck and evidence hashes, then obtain independent review and reconcile WP-1103 claims., friction=WP-1103 earlier review identified AC2 lacked dataset-specific absolute-path/mount-view proof; supplemental test now verifies /workspace mount present, dataset root absent, and absolute hidden validator unreadable. WP-1103 claim ownership metadata still references old runner-reclaim worktree; reconcile before closure., updated=2026-11-02T10:19:00Z, reviewer=/root/review_delta, verdict=APPROVED for 05c49df2 and 2a94f62e, retrieval=nexus-test eval_integrity.test.ts:1729 SSE tool-call stream; eval_harness.test.ts:43 deterministic reply pattern; provider_connect.test.ts:31 local provider harness, updated 14 minutes ago\n  - [doing] Resume WP-1104 full suite and roadmap release (state=WP-1103/1104 commit 05c49df2 created after final full suite passed (2136/0, 2 skipped), process-scope postcheck passed, and npm run build passed. Post-commit peer review requested; v1.1.2 full roadmap/release remains open., work_product=/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1104-integration, details=WP-1104 slice completed in commits 05c49df2 and 2a94f62e. Final full suite: 2138 tests, 2136 pass, 0 fail, 2 skipped; scope postcheck and npm run build pass; peer review APPROVED; nine WP-1104-specific claims released. Main checkout remains dirty and untouched. Continue full v1.1.2 roadmap, exact-head qualification, installed-RC, migration/compatibility, independent acceptance, and publication.), updated 26 minutes ago\n  - [done] WP-1104 standalone evaluator integration (commit=05c49df2, 2a94f62e, test_evidence=Full npm test: 2138 tests, 2136 pass, 0 fail, 2 skipped; scope measurement fixtures passed; log SHA-256 19aeb576f3be4f45b7507d79a0a1cfda1a46e9caebca59f87de9e60b17bf5a16, type_gate=npm run build passed, review=APPROVED by /root/review_delta on both commits, claim_release=9 WP-1104-specific file claims released; WP-1103 shared claims retained, work_product=/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1104-integration), updated 26 minutes ago"}]},"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":33028822}},"started_at_ms":1793615578029,"completed_at_ms":1793615578063}}
