{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T12:09:14.100Z","ordinal":41456,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a19c29-e674-75b3-b860-26e31d392abe","author":"/root/roadmap_next","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/roadmap_next\nPayload:\nRead-only audit complete. The roadmap and current release definition are misaligned:\n\n- [v1.1.2 release notes](/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1104-integration/docs/releases/v1.1.2.md) still define a patch-only promotion of the PR377 fix.\n- [v1.1.0 README](/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1104-integration/docs/v1.1.0/README.md) says the WP-11xx roadmap is not implemented in that release.\n- [WP-1104 plan](/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1104-integration/docs/v1.1.0/WP-1104-PLAN.md) records WP-1104’s source slice as done, while WP-1101, WP-1102, WP-1103 acceptance, and WP-1105..WP-1108 still have open integration or qualification work.\n\nThe integration worktree has uncommitted WP-1103 AC2 changes. I also observed other test processes still running on the shared host, including a full-suite child and a targeted `team_convergence` run. No additional tests should start until those processes finish and the suite claim is coordinated. I made no edits and ran no tests."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a19c21-eae7-7351-8f59-ab15f352b0bf","create_time":1793621354.1003647,"content_item_metadata":[{"provenance":{"type":"tool","namespace":"collaboration"}}]}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":1665}}
