{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T12:10:07.231Z","ordinal":41513,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a19c2a-b5ff-7553-9a94-f548497659d9","author":"/root/review_delta","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/review_delta\nPayload:\nFrom the log, the three failures look unrelated to the WP-1103 AC2 test change, but two need a quiet, isolated rerun before they can be classified:\n\n- **Upgrade confirmation test:** [log](/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1104-suite-snapshot/wp1103-ac2-suite.log:10220) shows it failed before reaching the expected decline message because the GitHub releases API request returned `fetch failed`. This is strong evidence of an external network failure.\n- **Sidecar cancellation:** [test](/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1104-suite-snapshot/cli/test/sidecar.test.ts:262) cancels after 200 ms against a 3-second fake response; `server.idle()` took about 4 seconds, exceeding its 2.5-second bound ([log](/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1104-suite-snapshot/wp1103-ac2-suite.log:10150)). The log does not establish whether cancellation was delayed by PR396 traffic or failed in the product.\n- **TUI surface:** the captured slow-inference screen lacked the expected `thinking` state, while showing the agent-wait screen; assertion failed at [tui_surface_e2e.test.ts](/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1104-suite-snapshot/cli/test/tui_surface_e2e.test.ts:184). This is consistent with timing-sensitive capture under load, but the log alone cannot prove contamination.\n\nThe WP-1103 delta in this snapshot is limited to the dataset test and plan addendum; none of these failing test files changed. Treat the full suite as failed for now. After PR396 traffic ends, rerun the two timing-sensitive tests serially to distinguish contention from defects; the upgrade test needs network availability or an isolated API fixture."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a19c21-eae7-7351-8f59-ab15f352b0bf","create_time":1793621407.231593,"content_item_metadata":[{"provenance":{"type":"tool","namespace":"collaboration"}}]}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":1667}}
