{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T12:10:33.629Z","ordinal":41537,"type":"token_usage_record","payload":{"thread_id":"01a192c0-f277-7f60-8574-21ce71edb8c2","turn_id":"01a19c21-eae7-7351-8f59-ab15f352b0bf","session_id":"01a192c0-f277-7f60-8574-21ce71edb8c2","root_turn_id":"01a19c21-eae7-7351-8f59-ab15f352b0bf","response_id":"resp_0fd4138577b17921016ae87db8ec5081a3b4b1626d9afed92b","usage":{"input_tokens":84245,"cached_input_tokens":82944,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":41,"reasoning_output_tokens":24,"total_tokens":84286},"turn_token_usage":{"input_tokens":11267040,"cached_input_tokens":11099008,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":31442,"reasoning_output_tokens":19060,"total_tokens":11298482},"thread_token_usage":{"input_tokens":800037634,"cached_input_tokens":793184640,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":1664724,"reasoning_output_tokens":845482,"total_tokens":801702358}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T12:10:34.788Z","ordinal":41538,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_01a19c2b-21a4-7631-b51b-10c80f54ecfe","call_id":"call_cfea4727e55e4ce68fb91b908f34be27","output":"{\"agents\":[{\"agent_name\":\"/root\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/review_delta\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"From the log, the three failures look unrelated to the WP-1103 AC2 test change, but two need a quiet, isolated rerun before they can be classified:\\n\\n- **Upgrade confirmation test:** [log](/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1104-suite-snapshot/wp1103-ac2-suite.log:10220) shows it failed before reaching the expected decline message because the GitHub releases API request returned `fetch failed`. This is strong evidence of an external network failure.\\n- **Sidecar cancellation:** [test](/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1104-suite-snapshot/cli/test/sidecar.test.ts:262) cancels after 200 ms against a 3-second fake response; `server.idle()` took about 4 seconds, exceeding its 2.5-second bound ([log](/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1104-suite-snapshot/wp1103-ac2-suite.log:10150)). The log does not establish whether cancellation was delayed by PR396 traffic or failed in the product.\\n- **TUI surface:** the captured slow-inference screen lacked the expected `thinking` state, while showing the agent-wait screen; assertion failed at [tui_surface_e2e.test.ts](/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1104-suite-snapshot/cli/test/tui_surface_e2e.test.ts:184). This is consistent with timing-sensitive capture under load, but the log alone cannot prove contamination.\\n\\nThe WP-1103 delta in this snapshot is limited to the dataset test and plan addendum; none of these failing test files changed. Treat the full suite as failed for now. After PR396 traffic ends, rerun the two timing-sensitive tests serially to distinguish contention from defects; the upgrade test needs network availability or an isolated API fixture.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/roadmap_next\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"Read-only audit complete. The roadmap and current release definition are misaligned:\\n\\n- [v1.1.2 release notes](/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1104-integration/docs/releases/v1.1.2.md) still define a patch-only promotion of the PR377 fix.\\n- [v1.1.0 README](/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1104-integration/docs/v1.1.0/README.md) says the WP-11xx roadmap is not implemented in that release.\\n- [WP-1104 plan](/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1104-integration/docs/v1.1.0/WP-1104-PLAN.md) records WP-1104’s source slice as done, while WP-1101, WP-1102, WP-1103 acceptance, and WP-1105..WP-1108 still have open integration or qualification work.\\n\\nThe integration worktree has uncommitted WP-1103 AC2 changes. I also observed other test processes still running on the shared host, including a full-suite child and a targeted `team_convergence` run. No additional tests should start until those processes finish and the suite claim is coordinated. I made no edits and ran no tests.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/suite_state_audit\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"Read-only audit complete. The last full suite is red (2,133 pass, 3 fail, 2 skipped), and unrelated PR396 suite and targeted test processes were still running at 12:08 UTC. No `SUITE` claim is currently held. Wait for those processes to exit, then claim `SUITE` and rerun against the exact integration source before committing WP-1103 AC2.\"}}]}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a19c21-eae7-7351-8f59-ab15f352b0bf","create_time":1793621434.7880065}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
