{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T12:23:37.691Z","ordinal":42210,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a19c37-13da-7ae3-b7a8-d8f40493c56b","call_id":"call_030b4d80e3f14d72984e5002a48cea96","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 3.5 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"\n## Upgrade\n\nOperation records are unchanged: operation schema version 2, as in v1.1.1. No migration runs, and v1.1.1 can read records written by v1.1.2.\n\n## Qualification\n\nThis candidate inherits the v1.1.1 qualification record. The source change is limited to `cli/src/core/operation_runner_execution.ts` (`unsubmittedMessages` and a new `promptCarriesMessage` helper) and its test. Release qualification for this RC is the release workflow's gates (version, notes, provenance), plus independent review of the fix (PR #377) and of this candidate.\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a19c35-8dbf-7b72-9a43-c0e91b05ed32","create_time":1793622217.6909826}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
