{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T12:57:34.206Z","ordinal":43338,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_01a19c56-26fe-7622-a353-2a6cd4a62f73","call_id":"call_03be811e60c345c283c9d1f46810051c","output":"{\"agents\":[{\"agent_name\":\"/root\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/review_delta\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"**APPROVED.** The updated matrix preserves the unprivileged-sandbox invariant in both G1.1-5’s proof requirements and the exact-candidate checklist. All eight work packages and five gates are listed; focused or partial evidence remains explicitly unqualified, and the record says the exact-candidate release is not qualified.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/v112_gate_matrix\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"## v1.1.2 roadmap and gate audit\\n\\nThe roadmap defines eight packages and five release gates in [ROADMAP.md](/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-scope-reconciliation/docs/v1.1.0/ROADMAP.md:44). Its package status is **not release-qualified**. The cross-slice audit in [WP-1104-PLAN.md](/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-scope-reconciliation/docs/v1.1.0/WP-1104-PLAN.md:77) is explicitly an audit lead; it requires revalidation on the integrated exact head.\\n\\n| Package | Evidence found | Status |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| WP-1101 tracing | `8a83c9e7` prototype lacks runtime event wiring and branch-head gate evidence. | **Open** |\\n| WP-1102 redaction | `ee7c8b1e` has partial redaction work; operator acceptance remains pending. | **Open** |\\n| WP-1103 datasets | Six-task installed-candidate test/evidence exists, but it proves execution coverage and request capture only. The latest full suite logged 2,133 pass, 3 fail, 2 skipped; fresh full-slice review is pending. | **Partial, unqualified** |\\n| WP-1104 standalone CLI | Source slice commits `05c49df2` and `2a94f62e` were reviewed and build-tested. Six-task focused package acceptance is recorded, but the final integrated candidate and full-slice review are not qualified. | **Source slice closed; release gate open** |\\n| WP-1105 evaluators | Worktree has untracked evaluator files, no commit or test evidence, and the documented WP-1103 dependency is still open. | **Open; preserve prior-owner work** |\\n| WP-1106 single-step mode | Approved plan exists, but implementation needs `cli/src/agent.ts`, currently claimed by the PR396 agent. | **Open; handoff required** |\\n| WP-1107 GBNF grammar | `9cb5f6de` prototype is unintegrated and lacks provider-path integration and validation. | **Open** |\\n| WP-1108 modernization | Branch `550112cd` is clean but has no PR or branch CI. Triage still calls for integrated CodeQL/dependency scans, compatibility and notice checks, reproducibility artifacts, and the broader G1.1-5 evidence. | **Partial, unqualified** |\\n\\n| Gate | Evidence required by roadmap | Status |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| G1.1-1 tracing | Valid OTel GenAI spans, credential safety, and trace-path confinement | **Open** |\\n| G1.1-2 dataset isolation | Full benchmark execution and proof that oracles do not reach candidate prompts | **Partial; exact-head suite and review open** |\\n| G1.1-3 CLI parity | Packaged CLI execution without developer dependencies | **Focused evidence exists; final candidate unverified** |\\n| G1.1-4 constrained decoding | At least 99.5% valid tool-call JSON across supported endpoints | **Open** |\\n| G1.1-5 dependency modernization | Zero deprecated/unmaintained packages and alerts, plus suite, cargo-deny, reproducibility, and compatibility evidence | **Open** |\\n\\nGitHub confirms v1.1.1 is published; v1.1.0 and v1.1.2 releases are absent. No v1.1.2 or RC tag is present. The scope correction is committed and approved on a separate local branch, but it has not been integrated into the WP-1104 branch. I made no edits, builds, or test runs for this audit.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/wp1108_acceptance_audit\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"WP-1108 is not ready for acceptance. Its branch is clean at `550112cd`, but it has no PR or branch-head CI evidence. The triage document records outstanding integrated CodeQL and Dependabot scans, runtime compatibility and notice-output checks, and package reproducibility evidence. The shared test process was still active, so no tests or builds were run.\\n\\nPreserve the existing branch. After the shared test host clears, WP-1108 could be claimed as a validation and integration slice, with its current commits and evidence gaps reviewed first. No edits or tests were made.\"}}]}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a19c45-79f8-74d0-bea2-bdff6a04336d","create_time":1793624254.206657}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
