pendent review says failures are outside WP-1103 files, but cancellation/TUI need quiet rerun and upgrade test needs reachable fixture/network. Other owner's PR396 suite PID 2050438/2050464 is verified live through 12:14 UTC in /home/mike/nexus-wt/pr396-takeover; no new tests started. Added shared conflict record. Reconciled the user-approved full-roadmap scope in dedicated branch v1/v112-scope-reconciliation commit 4b63cee0, exact-doc assertions and diff check pass, independent reviewer approved; scope file claim released. The source roadmap remains under Antigravity's DOCS_POST_V1_ROADMAP claim. No release yet., work_product=/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1104-integration, details=Continue full v1.1.2 scope. WP-1104 standalone eval source slice remains reviewed/closed at 05c49df2 and 2a94f62e. WP-1103 AC2 is implemented but uncommitted pending exact-source clean suite; current host has unclaimed PR396 suite traffic, so do not run tests. Release scope documentation is corrected in 4b63cee0 on v1/v112-scope-reconciliation (not pushed/merged); reviewer APPROVED. User has authorized full WP-1101..WP-1108 roadmap for v1.1.2. Continue to owner-level exact-head CI, independent acceptance, installed-RC qualification, and release publication while preserving dirty main checkout and leaving push/tag/publish to owner.), updated about 1 hour ago\"}]}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a19c45-79f8-74d0-bea2-bdff6a04336d","create_time":1793625391.493094}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
