 102 +++++\n docs/v1.1.2/ARCHITECTURE_ASSESSMENT.md             |  89 ++++\n docs/v1.1.2/CERI_ARCHITECTURE_ASSESSMENT.md        | 102 +++++\n docs/v1.1.2/CERI_PLAN.md                           | 220 ++++++++++\n docs/v1.1.2/PLAN.md                                | 167 +++++++\n docs/v1.1.2/ROADMAP.md                             | 188 ++++++++\n 44 files changed, 5859 insertions(+), 40 deletions(-)\na0d374e8 (origin/main) Merge pull request #396 from mikeholownych/v1/v112-specialist-orchestration\nefaf9ba9 (origin/v1/v112-specialist-orchestration, v1/pr396-takeover) fix(ceri): redact concatenated lowercase credential keys; keep token counts\n6fa72496 fix(recovery): a resumed read-only specialist does not inherit the write-verification obligation\n9bd4a215 fix(ceri): match credential keys by whole words and redact the whole value\nece18b7c fix(review): never assign a base after work began; worst verification wins; empty or unsafe diff base fails closed\nbbcf7cc1 fix(review): diff a non-isolated review against the operation's starting commit; fix doc drift\n17e1f76d fix(ceri): redact evidence by key name, not only by value text\n0f1b1e76 fix(team): accept specialist roles as /team targets; exempt read-only specialists from the verifier completion gate\n70aa756f fix(recovery): a retried read-only review does not inherit a write-verification obligation\n736d9271 fix(review): fail closed on missing diff or failed verifier; forward verifier evidence without integration\n145f065a fix(review): read diff file headers by hunk counts, drop stale JSDoc\nc34bf960 fix(recovery): offer only actions the agent's role and mode permit\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":1,"nanos":582937591}},"started_at_ms":1793650192117,"completed_at_ms":1793650193701}}
