{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T20:26:30.698Z","ordinal":45298,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a19df1-2baa-7d12-8d7d-50de01201c6c","call_id":"call_fe0a94d7efcd4c8f9f636825ea7cba91","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 1.6 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Saved to \\\"v1.1.2-release\\\" in nexus-code. Still open in it:\\n- v1.1.2-release: state=20:26 UTC: full npm test remains active on candidate snapshot a0d374e8; isolated HOME and log unchanged. Process tree 518706/518807/518808/518815 live for 13m; log advanced to 222,935 bytes at 20:26:15 and is in eval qualification/comparative tests. Multiple earlier assertions remain red; final summary pending. SUITE held and heartbeat refreshed. Qualification scope doc now has independent APPROVED review across both the user-approved WP-1101–1108 roadmap and current v1.1.2 roadmap; Item 3 remains OPEN., phase=GREEN, gate=Exact npm test active with failures observed; type/build/process-scope final statuses pending, next=Wait for full npm test and process-scope postcheck to complete; diagnose failures and rerun after fixing prerequisites/defects., friction=Exact-source npm test has not completed; early failing test groups remain unclassified., updated=2026-11-02T20:26:22Z, reviewer=/root/review_delta, verdict=APPROVED release-scope alignment; WP-1103 source diff previously approved; exact gate pending., retrieval=nexus-test eval_integrity.test.ts:1729 SSE tool-call stream; eval_harness.test.ts:43 deterministic reply pattern; provider_connect.test.ts:31 local provider harness, active_agents=Read-only audit delegated to /root/v112_unblocked_work to identify safe progress that does not load the shared test host., updated 1 minute ago\\n- ...1 more line; read them with work_state_read\"}]}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a19de1-2f43-7663-a2d9-f17adf8cb101","create_time":17