mention, and read_findings returns it in full (3.698187ms)\\n  ✔ findings far beyond the 24K bound: the record stays within it, every finding is shown or named, and a late fact stays visible and recoverable (107.269938ms)\\n  ✔ conflicting findings are both kept, in order and unmerged, and a search of the findings returns both (91.383995ms)\\n  ✔ a condensed finding keeps its source list's start, every source it came from stays held, and its removal note says how to read it (128.606453ms)\\n  ✔ findings persist with the task state: a restart restores them in full, and the next finding continues their ids (309.546486ms)\\n  ✔ mid-turn progress saves the findings with the conversation, and a restore never reuses an id the restored memory names (1138.81165ms)\\n  ✔ findings an earlier version recorded without ids are kept under ids: listed and readable once not shown, and a shortened copy is never claimed recoverable (1286.46133ms)\\n  ✔ a step's notices stay with that step: durable notes and findings checkpoints get only what the tool returned (88.844057ms)\\n  ✔ the model can read its findings through the read_findings tool (3456.791885ms)\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a19de1-2f43-7663-a2d9-f17adf8cb101","create_time":1793653542.3700054}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
