{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T21:05:53.599Z","ordinal":46524,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a19e15-39be-71e1-807c-c5671c479bba","call_id":"call_9dd3696208e04ecebde3a0132a9cd69d","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 10.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"319a8f\",\"wall_time_seconds\":10.000613508,\"session_id\":41588,\"original_token_count\":803,\"output\":\"  ✔ the model sees, as part of the output, that a head-limited command and a depth-bounded file_tree may not show everything (2376.390882ms)\\n  ✔ output cut short by a limit says so: a head-limited command, a fold, a search at its cap, and file_tree's depth (3.077352ms)\\n  ✔ archive: what compaction replaced is searchable with read_archive, verbatim and bounded (3.42765ms)\\n  ✔ archive: the agent keeps replaced originals searchable and restores them on resume (97.062283ms)\\n  ✔ CTX-06: Nexus's own notes in the user role are not recorded as the operator's task requests (41.173365ms)\\n  ✔ CTX-04: grep -m / --max-count, sed -n ranges, sed Nq and awk NR limits are limits too (2.742545ms)\\n  ✔ against this repository: a depth-bounded file_tree count is marked as not the tracked-file count, and a head-limited search as unable to show absence (173.803327ms)\\n✔ G: recorded findings under memory pressure stay distinct, sourced and recoverable; cut-off output cannot show absence (9311.724674ms)\\n▶ CTX-01 residuals\\n  ✔ read_findings says a named finding's text was lost rather than never recorded; a failed mid-turn save is reported once (47.122528ms)\\n✔ CTX-01 residuals (47.454349ms)\\n✔ a unit budget below the resource capacity blocks before inference when the prompt does not fit (7.087081ms)\\n✔ a prompt that fits the unit budget runs, and the estimate is recorded (1.547669ms)\\n✔ a budget at or above the resource capacity leaves resource pressure to context admission (0.716264ms)\\n✔ a prompt over the resource limit is left to admission even when a budget is set (0.741031ms)\\n✔ a unit budget must be a positive integer (2.179367ms)\\n✔ no budget means no preflight and no recorded estimate (0.637688ms)\\n✔ a real agent estimates the next turn with its own budget and tools (111.065549ms)\\n✔ a checkpoint copies the conversation and restore brings it back with a backup (126.007593ms)\\n✔ restore refuses tampered checkpoints and lifecycle states it does not own (113.306307ms)\\n✔ restoring one unit keeps an operation-level decision intact (487.71571ms)\\n✔ checkpoints refuse traversal, running units, missing conversations and unknown names (50.224233ms)\\n✔ a checkpoint copies the conversation journals too and restores them without the originals (120.223797ms)\\n✔ changing only a journal creates a new checkpoint bundle instead of overwriting the old one (356.918845ms)\\n✔ bundle hashes cannot collide across journal boundaries (381.859364ms)\\n✔ an identical checkpoint reuses its existing bundle without rewriting it (210.575752ms)\\n✔ a failed first bundle write is cleaned up so checkpoint retry succeeds (814.792684ms)\\n✔ restore removes a journal created after the checkpoint (125.069238ms)\\n✔ a journal write failure rolls back the task and preserves the blocked operation (551.532196ms)\\n✔ the lift_context_budget decision clears the cap and makes the unit runnable (2.059063ms)\\n✔ the CLI checkpoints, lists and restores a unit conversation (4863.585446ms)\\n✔ ACC-V11-CTX-01: the budget decision names the binding bound, the estimate and its source (1.221968ms)\\n✔ a budget at or above the resource limit records the resource as the source (0.67042ms)\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a19de1-2f43-7663-a2d9-f17adf8cb101","create_time":1793653553.5989623}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
