{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T21:11:14.113Z","ordinal":46710,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a19e1a-1dc1-7261-aea7-27e6ae6f1698","call_id":"call_eac8cb8c9bfe4d9ba554672d78c2929f","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 10.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"7b9737\",\"wall_time_seconds\":10.000541771,\"session_id\":41588,\"original_token_count\":1042,\"output\":\"✖ hardened checks hide oracle source from candidate code and reject empty-output commands (303.32261ms)\\n✔ test data, symlinked paths, new Python packages, oversized files and manifest deletions never weaken the checks (17.763963ms)\\n✔ Rust and Go compile-time file inclusion directives refuse hardened checks (3.829585ms)\\n✖ Go and Rust hidden sources are absent during build audits and test execution (89.37867ms)\\n✔ manifest guards fail closed on TOML headers they do not recognise, go.mod blocks and new manifests (4.536545ms)\\n✖ a correct deliverable passes the hidden test; a wrong one fails it and is never VERIFIED (A1) (299.00853ms)\\n✔ standalone profile context discovery is not overridden by the harness default (26.476203ms)\\n✖ a standalone server-profile run discovers context instead of forcing the harness default (278.755251ms)\\n✖ T4 smoke: an overloaded endpoint is waited out and the task still completes; the fault is recorded (278.77327ms)\\n✖ T4 smoke: a reply cut at the output limit is never run as a tool call, and the run ends truthfully (293.99136ms)\\n✖ peer run records the executable version and effective budget (1281.681568ms)\\n✖ Goose adapter applies the matched turn, context, output, and temperature budgets (2585.079704ms)\\n✔ version identity probes run inside the sandbox and reject a mismatched expected peer version (341.233337ms)\\n✔ qualification refuses peer output limits that differ from the installed Nexus limit (3.302228ms)\\n✔ qualification separates native context discovery from explicit operator overrides (2.657569ms)\\n✔ --pairs reports only model-, limit-, and budget-matched Nexus, Goose, and OpenCode runs (135.910161ms)\\n✔ --pairs rejects a peer run with a different model fingerprint or effective budget (316.830887ms)\\n✔ host preflight accepts Bubblewrap 0.12.0 and later (5.667755ms)\\n✔ host preflight rejects vulnerable or unrecognized Bubblewrap versions (2.113557ms)\\n✔ operator protection selects the account home despite an isolated HOME (73.553477ms)\\n✔ invalid account identity or home fails closed (10.930958ms)\\n✔ the model proxy forwards requests and counts answers and upstream failures (212.204107ms)\\n✔ the evaluation proxy authenticates the local run token and replaces it with the upstream credential (41.612248ms)\\n✔ the evaluation proxy bounds request count and body size (33.027403ms)\\n✔ the evaluation proxy bounds concurrent inference and cancels upstream work on client abort (56.470888ms)\\n✔ the evaluation proxy enforces per-request and aggregate requested completion-token ceilings (35.837107ms)\\n✔ the evaluation proxy never forwards the local token when the upstream is unauthenticated (14.235722ms)\\n✔ infrastructure reruns use one rule for every agent: a crash after the model answered is scored (128.526898ms)\\n✔ contaminated runs leave the pass rate, crashes are counted, and reruns are listed (75.630566ms)\\n✔ T4 scoring requires all nine classes and five injected runs per class (691.405758ms)\\n✔ task validation: pinned repos, one source, and black-box hidden oracle for qualification (34.298919ms)\\n✔ T4 fixture evidence requires an exact CLI runner receipt and measured storage boundary (3.340993ms)\\n✔ black-box oracle keeps canary expectations outside the candidate process and returns sanitized evidence (390.303811ms)\\n✖ Python black-box oracle uses only pinned offline Go and Rust toolchains, or fails preflight (60.174153ms)\\n✔ a qualification run is refused without a model fingerprint (weights, server build, sampling) (1.986552ms)\\n✔ qualification requires frozen request and aggregate output budgets (1.444909ms)\\n✔ hidden tests must be unreadable to the agent's own user (3.241841ms)\\n✔ candidate agents receive only the approved read-only Go and Rust toolchain mounts (1.50106ms)\\n✖ qualification runtime mounts cannot overlap the task tree, held-out store, or private validator paths (782.705835ms)\\n✔ qualification remains fail-closed without enforced aggregate resource controls (6.334453ms)\\n✖ resource contract: candidate memory, processes, storage and CPU are kernel-bounded and every process is reaped (114.319327ms)\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a19de1-2f43-7663-a2d9-f17adf8cb101","create_time":1793653874.113595}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
