{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T21:13:01.033Z","ordinal":46772,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a19e1b-bf69-71e0-9261-e6d0e90a6cfb","call_id":"call_7e82cc0e5ba340cbb4cde94e816f1d00","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 10.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"5c6c8b\",\"wall_time_seconds\":10.00137806,\"session_id\":41588,\"original_token_count\":2202,\"output\":\"  ✔ RustCoreBridge executes outline_file tool for compact AST context conservation (18.448862ms)\\n  ✔ AutonomousAgent preserves invariant system prompt prefix across multiple turns for KV cache reuse (45.138823ms)\\n  ✔ WorktreeManager manages ephemeral git worktrees with zero pollution of working tree (654.125874ms)\\n  ✔ FlightRecorder and FlightPlayer record and replay deterministic session execution (43.19372ms)\\n  ✔ AutonomousAgent exposes WorktreeManager and FlightRecorder with state getters (243.560765ms)\\n  ✔ HunkStager parses unified diffs and stages individual hunks with surgical precision (234.057534ms)\\n  ✔ BM25Index, VectorIndex, and Reciprocal Rank Fusion rank code matches effectively (9.264798ms)\\n  ✔ HybridSearchEngine indexes workspace and discovers code matches (9.497415ms)\\n  ✔ AutonomousAgent dynamically routes cognitive tiers between planner and coder models (77.123116ms)\\n  ✔ BenchmarkEvaluator loads SWE-bench datasets and renders markdown scorecards (3.667587ms)\\n  ✔ SynthesizerEngine tracks RED-GREEN-REFACTOR protocol state and transitions (4.986748ms)\\n  ✔ BrowserDriver navigates web resources, captures screenshots, and handles DOM interactions (33.451135ms)\\n  ✔ KnowledgeGraph persists project idioms across sessions, filters queries, and exports prompt section (90.432437ms)\\n  ✔ SecretsVault reversibly quarantines sensitive API keys and tokens before egress and restores them (9.088397ms)\\n✔ Nexus Code Test Suite (70858.278851ms)\\n▶ harness.sh entry\\n  ✔ no arguments in a terminal open the live TUI (1095.680519ms)\\n  ✔ no arguments without a terminal run the REPL (580.120683ms)\\n  ✔ an unbuilt TUI falls back to the REPL and says why (524.94485ms)\\n  ✔ --repl keeps the readline REPL with its options (661.268943ms)\\n  ✔ --live passes sidecar options after one separator (900.332271ms)\\n  ✔ ACC-PKG-04: unknown command exits non-zero with unknown command (929.518337ms)\\n  ✔ ACC-PKG-04: recognized subcommand executes without being converted to run (576.419285ms)\\n✔ harness.sh entry (5273.898444ms)\\n✔ the test suite runs under a throwaway HOME, never the operator's (1.957279ms)\\n▶ htmlToText\\n  ✔ passes plain text through with collapsed whitespace (3.171261ms)\\n  ✔ keeps a stray < before whitespace or digits as literal text (0.680018ms)\\n  ✔ drops simple tags (0.623243ms)\\n  ✔ drops script elements with their contents and attributes (1.267325ms)\\n  ✔ drops style elements with their contents (0.723215ms)\\n  ✔ ends at the first close tag per raw-text semantics (0.412611ms)\\n  ✔ does not accept a longer close-tag name as a raw-text close (0.609543ms)\\n  ✔ stays linear across many raw-text elements (31.12722ms)\\n  ✔ cannot be reassembled by nested malformed tags (1.164338ms)\\n  ✔ drops the rest of the input for unterminated tags or elements (1.35388ms)\\n  ✔ handles comments, doctypes, and processing instructions (0.76565ms)\\n  ✔ does not let a quoted > end a tag early (0.521677ms)\\n  ✔ ends comments at --> even when they contain > (0.570187ms)\\n  ✔ runs in bounded time on pathological shapes (12.158732ms)\\n✔ htmlToText (60.214158ms)\\n▶ decodeHtmlEntities\\n  ✔ decodes the fixed named set (1.269594ms)\\n  ✔ decodes amp last so double-encoded entities stay literal (0.70752ms)\\n  ✔ decodes decimal and hex numeric references in range (0.848233ms)\\n  ✔ leaves unknown entities untouched (0.457885ms)\\n  ✔ never decodes a numeric entity into a terminal control character (0.602078ms)\\n✔ decodeHtmlEntities (5.259734ms)\\n▶ htmlToReadableText\\n  ✔ combines extraction and decoding in the safe order (0.690485ms)\\n  ✔ never emits tags from hostile input (0.510421ms)\\n  ✔ strips raw terminal controls from untrusted page text (0.452005ms)\\n  ✔ keeps printable text when numeric entities try to inject escape sequences (0.680221ms)\\n  ✔ normalizes entity-decoded carriage returns and other line separators (0.434686ms)\\n✔ htmlToReadableText (3.571685ms)\\n✔ extractModifiedFilesFromDiff accurately extracts paths from git unified diff including deletions and renames (7.914438ms)\\n✔ detectScopeViolations flags files modified outside authorized scope (1.123755ms)\\n✔ buildReviewEvidencePackage strips implementer narrative and freezes scope (0.832815ms)\\n✔ formatIndependentReviewPrompt warns about scope violations and formats prompt (1.31492ms)\\n✔ parseIndependentReviewVerdict handles valid ACCEPT and enforces fail-closed gates (2.573079ms)\\n✔ extractModifiedFilesFromDiff decodes Git-quoted paths, keeps bare paths with spaces, and ignores hunk lines (7.625767ms)\\n✔ parseIndependentReviewVerdict rejects missing or malformed schema fields instead of coercing them away (1.477277ms)\\n✔ a removed '-- before' line and an added '++ after' line inside a hunk are not file headers (0.398232ms)\\n✔ hunk counts are consumed across several files and hunks, with omitted counts meaning 1 (0.704373ms)\\n✔ a plain unified diff with several files and hunks is still parsed, including hunk content that looks like headers (0.825084ms)\\n✔ a header that cannot be parsed after a completed hunk still fails closed (0.726658ms)\\n✔ a plain-diff hunk whose counts overstate its body cannot swallow the next file's headers (0.53629ms)\\n[provider_capabilities] reason=step model=m context 65536 (client_default); output allowance 8192 (client_default); discovery unsupported (catalog lists no limits); token counting unsupported\\n[context_admission] step=1 request_id=ec256572-8ca2-4983-9e70-aaa8830b0e4a state=admitted e