{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T21:16:59.066Z","ordinal":46921,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a192c0-f277-7f60-8574-21ce71edb8c2","turn_id":"01a19de1-2f43-7663-a2d9-f17adf8cb101","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0fd4138577b17921016ae8fdc955f081a391e9cbcd1696d423","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The exact suite is still running serially. It has confirmed 21 red evaluator cases so far; the ordinary continuation, core handshake, packaging, recovery, and most CLI groups are passing. I also found an environment leak in the test launcher: its `tsx` loader came from the separate integration worktree, so I’m treating this run as diagnostic until I can repeat it with the loader path isolated."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793654217369,"completed_at_ms":1793654219066}}
