ile-time file inclusion directives refuse hardened checks (4.893671ms)\\n✖ Go and Rust hidden sources are absent during build audits and test execution (96.206228ms)\\n✔ manifest guards fail closed on TOML headers they do not recognise, go.mod blocks and new manifests (12.181002ms)\\n✔ the model proxy forwards requests and counts answers and upstream failures (145.010402ms)\\n✔ the evaluation proxy authenticates the local run token and replaces it with the upstream credential (23.868568ms)\\n✔ the evaluation proxy bounds request count and body size (18.743868ms)\\n✔ the evaluation proxy bounds concurrent inference and cancels upstream work on client abort (47.060735ms)\\n✔ the evaluation proxy enforces per-request and aggregate requested completion-token ceilings (33.557032ms)\\n✔ the evaluation proxy never forwards the local token when the upstream is unauthenticated (11.995568ms)\\n✔ infrastructure reruns use one rule for every agent: a crash after the model answered is scored (129.629372ms)\\n✔ contaminated runs leave the pass rate, crashes are counted, and reruns are listed (102.51334ms)\\n✔ T4 scoring requires all nine classes and five injected runs per class (575.137202ms)\\n✔ task validation: pinned repos, one source, and black-box hidden oracle for qualification (42.204634ms)\\n✔ T4 fixture evidence requires an exact CLI runner receipt and measured storage boundary (1.889943ms)\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a19de1-2f43-7663-a2d9-f17adf8cb101","create_time":1793655858.8439164}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
