md\ndocs/v1.1.0/operation-view.schema.json\ndocs/v1.1.2/ARCHITECTURE_ASSESSMENT.md\ndocs/v1.1.2/CERI_ARCHITECTURE_ASSESSMENT.md\ndocs/v1.1.2/CERI_PLAN.md\ndocs/v1.1.2/NON_PROGRESS_RECOVERY.md\ndocs/v1.1.2/PLAN.md\ndocs/v1.1.2/ROADMAP.md\na0d374e8 (HEAD) Merge pull request #396 from mikeholownych/v1/v112-specialist-orchestration\nefaf9ba9 (origin/v1/v112-specialist-orchestration) fix(ceri): redact concatenated lowercase credential keys; keep token counts\n6fa72496 fix(recovery): a resumed read-only specialist does not inherit the write-verification obligation\n9bd4a215 fix(ceri): match credential keys by whole words and redact the whole value\nece18b7c fix(review): never assign a base after work began; worst verification wins; empty or unsafe diff base fails closed\nbbcf7cc1 fix(review): diff a non-isolated review against the operation's starting commit; fix doc drift\n17e1f76d fix(ceri): redact evidence by key name, not only by value text\n0f1b1e76 fix(team): accept specialist roles as /team targets; exempt read-only specialists from the verifier completion gate\n70aa756f fix(recovery): a retried read-only review does not inherit a write-verification obligation\n736d9271 fix(review): fail closed on missing diff or failed verifier; forward verifier evidence without integration\n145f065a fix(review): read diff file headers by hunk counts, drop stale JSDoc\nc34bf960 fix(recovery): offer only actions the agent's role and mode permit\n M cli/scripts/run_tests.mjs\n M cli/src/index.ts\n M docs/releases/v1.1.2-rc.1.md\n M docs/releases/v1.1.2.md\n M docs/v1.1.0/SPEC-EVALUATION.md\n M eval/README.md\n M eval/run.mjs\n M scripts/package-linux.sh\n?? cli/src/eval_cli.ts\n?? cli/test/eval_cli.test.ts\n?? cli/test/eval_dataset.test.ts\n?? docs/releases/v1.1.2-qualification.md\n?? docs/reviews/evidence/v1/wp-1103-g1.1-2/\n?? docs/v1.1.0/WP-1103-ORACLE-ISOLATION.md\n?? docs/v1.1.0/WP-1104-PLAN.md\n?? eval/dataset.mjs\n?? eval/dataset.test.mjs\n?? eval/datasets/\n?? eval/package_runtime.test.mjs\n?? eval/runner_api.mjs\n?? eval/runner_integrity.mjs\n?? scripts/stage_eval_runtime.mjs\n cli/scripts/run_tests.mjs      |   6 +-\n cli/src/index.ts               |  46 +++++++++++--\n docs/releases/v1.1.2-rc.1.md   |  24 ++++---\n docs/releases/v1.1.2.md        |  10 ++-\n docs/v1.1.0/SPEC-EVALUATION.md |  58 +++++++---------\n eval/README.md                 |  31 +++++++++\n eval/run.mjs                   | 146 +++++++++++++++--------------------------\n scripts/package-linux.sh       |   1 +\n 8 files changed, 176 insertions(+), 146 deletions(-)\nlrwxrwxrwx 1 mike mike 19 Nov  2 21:43 cli/node_modules/.bin/tsx -> ../tsx/dist/cli.mjs\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1103-a0d374e8/cli/node_modules/tsx/dist/preflight.cjs\n5ecdd84e573c2c6ee0c7cda6c038b6a4043ad002ec7a004cceaef3dceb67320e  /tmp/v112-eval-focused.log\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":885499955}},"started_at_ms":1793656372508,"completed_at_ms":1793656373394}}
