tests, 2136 pass, 0 fail, 2 skipped; scope measurement fixtures passed; log SHA-256 19aeb576f3be4f45b7507d79a0a1cfda1a46e9caebca59f87de9e60b17bf5a16, type_gate=npm run build passed, review=APPROVED by /root/review_delta on both commits, claim_release=9 WP-1104-specific file claims released; WP-1103 shared claims retained, work_product=/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-wp1104-integration), updated about 13 hours ago\n  - [done] V112 release scope reconciliation (work_product=/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-scope-reconciliation/docs/releases/v1.1.2.md, details=Commit 4b63cee0 on v1/v112-scope-reconciliation. Corrected docs/releases/v1.1.2.md to reflect user-selected full WP-1101..WP-1108 roadmap, failed/unpublished v1.1.0 and published v1.1.1 predecessor, and explicitly incomplete implementation/qualification. Scope assertions and git diff --check pass; independent review_delta APPROVED. Push/tag/publish remain owner actions.), updated about 11 hours ago"}]},"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":27406535}},"started_at_ms":1793659786362,"completed_at_ms":1793659786389}}
