{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T22:50:08.712Z","ordinal":49159,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a192c0-f277-7f60-8574-21ce71edb8c2","turn_id":"01a19de1-2f43-7663-a2d9-f17adf8cb101","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-0a2d4911-efba-407c-b720-808c4d2268ee","process_id":"16108","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","rg -n 'WP-1103|Release-gate status|Exact-candidate|Current evidence|suite' docs/releases/v1.1.2-qualification.md"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-integrated-exact","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"search","cmd":"rg -n 'WP-1103|Release-gate status|Exact-candidate|Current evidence|suite' docs/releases/v1.1.2-qualification.md","query":"WP-1103|Release-gate status|Exact-candidate|Current evidence|suite","path":"v1.1.2-qualification.md"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"16:| Item 4 — Multi-stage escalation | Explicitly cut from PR #396 and superseded by merged PR #398 recovery behavior. | Qualify the superseding recovery behavior through the exact-head suite; do not reintroduce the cut state machine. |\n27:| WP-1103 — Versioned evaluation datasets | Versioned datasets with separate examples/oracles and regression/benchmark splits; candidate prompts cannot access oracles. | Integration branch `v1/v112-wp1104-integration` is at docs-scope HEAD `eb6884df` with pending AC2 test and plan edits. The mount-view test passed focused 3/3; source-level peer review accepted the diff after removal of a duplicate, misleading evidence file. The full snapshot run at `00a8cb4d` failed (2,133 pass, 3 fail, 2 skipped; log SHA-256 `e6ea08b2b56c3f1ada337290db9ae0601921a23f99fd1ca50e7d95b507f870e9`) during concurrent PR396 test traffic. That snapshot is not the exact integration source and has no process-scope postcheck. | **PARTIAL / UNQUALIFIED** | Clean serialized full suite and process-scope postcheck on the exact integration source; resolve or independently classify all failures; complete fresh full-slice review and candidate-specific evidence. |\n29:| WP-1105 — Deterministic code evaluators | Modular AST, build, typecheck, diff-boundary, and JSON-repair evaluators. | Worktree `v1/wp-1105-evaluators` has untracked `eval/evaluators/` files and no WP-1105 commit or test evidence. Its documented dependency on WP-1103 remains open. | **OPEN** | Resolve owner handoff while preserving existing files; complete implementation, tests, review, and exact-head gate after WP-1103. |\n34:## Release-gate status\n36:| Gate | Required proof | Current evidence | Status |\n42:| G1.1-5 — Zero technical debt | Zero deprecated/unmaintained packages, zero CodeQL alerts and compiler warnings, plus required suite/PTY, cargo-deny, npm scans, reproducibility, and CLI option compatibility without breaking unprivileged sandbox invariants. | WP-1108 branch has no branch CI; integrated scan and qualification evidence remain outstanding. | **OPEN** |\n44:## Exact-candidate release checklist\n50:- The full test suite, type checks, lint/security gates, migration and compatibility checks pass on the exact head.\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":768246932}},"started_at_ms":1793659807941,"completed_at_ms":1793659808710}}
{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T22:50:10.321Z","ordinal":49160,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a19e74-b211-7073-86c9-8ffc1339f01c","call_id":"call_989a6299460c449a8d382f9b8eb04810","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 4.1 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"16:| Item 4 — Multi-stage escalation | Explicitly cut from PR #396 and superseded by merged PR #398 recovery behavior. | Qualify the superseding recovery behavior through the exact-head suite; do not reintroduce the cut state machine. |\n27:| WP-1103 — Versioned evaluation datasets | Versioned datasets with separate examples/oracles and regression/benchmark splits; candidate prompts cannot access oracles. | Integration branch `v1/v112-wp1104-integration` is at docs-scope HEAD `eb6884df` with pending AC2 test and plan edits. The mount-view test passed focused 3/3; source-level peer review accepted the diff after removal of a duplicate, misleading evidence file. The full snapshot run at `00a8cb4d` failed (2,133 pass, 3 fail, 2 skipped; log SHA-256 `e6ea08b2b56c3f1ada337290db9ae0601921a23f99fd1ca50e7d95b507f870e9`) during concurrent PR396 test traffic. That snapshot is not the exact integration source and has no process-scope postcheck. | **PARTIAL / UNQUALIFIED** | Clean serialized full suite and process-scope postcheck on the exact integration source; resolve or independently classify all failures; complete fresh full-slice review and candidate-specific evidence. |\n29:| WP-1105 — Deterministic code evaluators | Modular AST, build, typecheck, diff-boundary, and JSON-repair evaluators. | Worktree `v1/wp-1105-evaluators` has untracked `eval/evaluators/` files and no WP-1105 commit or test evidence. Its documented dependency on WP-1103 remains open. | **OPEN** | Resolve owner handoff while preserving existing files; complete implementation, tests, review, and exact-head gate after WP-1103. |\n34:## Release-gate status\n36:| Gate | Required proof | Current evidence | Status |\n42:| G1.1-5 — Zero technical debt | Zero deprecated/unmaintained packages, zero CodeQL alerts and compiler warnings, plus required suite/PTY, cargo-deny, npm scans, reproducibility, and CLI option compatibility without breaking unprivileged sandbox invariants. | WP-1108 branch has no branch CI; integrated scan and qualification evidence remain outstanding. | **OPEN** |\n44:## Exact-candidate release checklist\n50:- The full test suite, type checks, lint/security gates, migration and compatibility checks pass on the exact head.\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a19de1-2f43-7663-a2d9-f17adf8cb101","create_time":1793659810.3213625}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
