{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T22:54:19.166Z","ordinal":49318,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a192c0-f277-7f60-8574-21ce71edb8c2","turn_id":"01a19de1-2f43-7663-a2d9-f17adf8cb101","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0fd4138577b17921016ae9149a6f0081a3a01380542adde281","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The independent reviewer found one remaining AC2 test gap: the mount probe could miss a bind mount sourced from a nested path inside the dataset tree. The current isolation guard appears to reject it, but the test needs to detect that alias case. I’m adding that case now; the reviewer also confirmed the package dispatch changes had no separate blocker."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793660058454,"completed_at_ms":1793660059166}}
