{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T22:59:58.271Z","ordinal":49509,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a192c0-f277-7f60-8574-21ce71edb8c2","turn_id":"01a19de1-2f43-7663-a2d9-f17adf8cb101","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0fd4138577b17921016ae915ed8b4081a3b617492d8dcf3cff","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The pinned package now passes the six-task installed acceptance, and the packaged runtime checks pass when run with the fresh package. I also reran the dataset isolation test after widening the mount probe; all three assertions pass, including unreadability of the hidden validator path. The review remains open for a fresh look at the updated test and ledger."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793660397693,"completed_at_ms":1793660398271}}
{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T22:59:58.274Z","ordinal":49510,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","status":"completed","id":"msg_0fd4138577b17921016ae915ed8b4081a3b617492d8dcf3cff","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"The pinned package now passes the six-task installed acceptance, and the packaged runtime checks pass when run with the fresh package. I also reran the dataset isolation test after widening the mount probe; all three assertions pass, including unreadability of the hidden validator path. The review remains open for a fresh look at the updated test and ledger.","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a19de1-2f43-7663-a2d9-f17adf8cb101","create_time":1793660397.6735942,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_0fd4138577b17921016ae915ed8b4081a3b617492d8dcf3cff","turn_id":"01a19de1-2f43-7663-a2d9-f17adf8cb101","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a19e7d-aac2-7c42-94e0-eac1a0a147c2","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":2043}}
{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T23:00:03.790Z","ordinal":49511,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0fd4138577b17921016ae915ee39dc81a38138067c32872e53","status":"completed","call_id":"call_4a4815c6eccb4b1c9960c674e153ec20","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-integrated-exact/docs/releases/v1.1.2-qualification.md\\n@@\\n-| WP-1103 — Versioned evaluation datasets | Versioned datasets with separate examples/oracles and regression/benchmark splits; candidate prompts cannot access oracles. | Candidate source tree `ac52532540209a39e2aad86af84a16ba375dd770`, based on `a0d374e8`, passed the serialized complete CLI suite: 2,251 total, 2,246 passed, 0 failed, 5 skipped; process-scope fixtures passed. Log SHA-256 `bae2a5b6c3472ab2dbcbb446867adc2c0a2ddc6fe2e25b7753e3be340fa85cb0`. The focused evaluator suite also passed 91/91 (log SHA-256 `5ecdd84e573c2c6ee0c7cda6c038b6a4043ad002ec7a004cceaef3dceb67320e`). TypeScript and Rust release builds passed on the identical source tree. | **IMPLEMENTATION / GATE PASS; REVIEW PENDING** | Independent review of this exact-base candidate; finish manifest-pinned six-task installed CLI acceptance and record evidence; commit and rerun required gates on exact commit. |\\n+| WP-1103 — Versioned evaluation datasets | Versioned datasets with separate examples/oracles and regression/benchmark splits; candidate prompts cannot access oracles. | Candidate is based on `a0d374e8`. The serialized complete CLI suite passed: 2,251 total, 2,246 passed, 0 failed, 5 skipped; process-scope fixtures passed. Log SHA-256 `bae2a5b6c3472ab2dbcbb446867adc2c0a2ddc6fe2e25b7753e3be340fa85cb0`. The focused evaluator suite passed 91/91 (log SHA-256 `5ecdd84e573c2c6ee0c7cda6c038b6a4043ad002ec7a004cceaef3dceb67320e`). TypeScript and Rust release builds passed. A pinned Bookworm package built from this candidate passed six-task installed acceptance, archive SHA-256 `27dbbb8120e755061e92218eaceb5e12b7d9457230b9b0aa82b96d28cc3791ee`; evidence is `acceptance-27dbbb8120e7.json`. The full suite's six-task acceptance was skipped because its package/evidence variables were unset; that run is not the acceptance proof. The reviewer identified a nested-mount detection gap in AC2; the probe now matches dataset roots and descendants, and the focused AC2 test passed 3/3 after the fix. | **SOURCE TEST GATE PASS; INSTALLED ACCEPTANCE PASS; FINAL REVIEW PENDING** | Obtain fresh independent review of the AC2 test fix and evidence; commit, bind the package to that exact commit, and rerun required gates on the exact commit. |\\n@@\\n-| G1.1-2 — Dataset decoupling | All benchmark tasks execute and no oracle data reaches candidate prompts; exact candidate and process-scope evidence retained. | Candidate source tree `ac52532540209a39e2aad86af84a16ba375dd770` passed the complete suite and process-scope postcheck; focused evaluator suite passed 91/91. The six-task installed CLI acceptance with recomputed manifest digest is still pending. | **PARTIAL / UNQUALIFIED** |\\n+| G1.1-2 — Dataset decoupling | All benchmark tasks execute and no oracle data reaches candidate prompts; exact candidate and process-scope evidence retained. | Complete suite and process-scope postcheck passed; focused evaluator suite passed 91/91; the AC2 nested-mount probe passed 3/3; and the pinned Bookworm package passed six-task installed acceptance with recomputed manifest SHA-256 `05ee2fa33ae5f6d6afc35df2e003c913de3f7bf0f817d2f76c709c16fb640d43`. Acceptance archive SHA-256 `27dbbb8120e755061e92218eaceb5e12b7d9457230b9b0aa82b96d28cc3791ee`. The archive was built before commit and lacks final commit binding; reviewer follow-up is pending. | **PARTIAL / UNQUALIFIED** |\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a19de1-2f43-7663-a2d9-f17adf8cb101","create_time":1793660398.2508547}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T23:00:03.820Z","ordinal":49512,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a192c0-f277-7f60-8574-21ce71edb8c2","turn_id":"01a19de1-2f43-7663-a2d9-f17adf8cb101","item":{"type":"FileChange","id":"exec-57441fb1-a73b-4985-b914-81b6a78007f2","changes":{"/home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-integrated-exact/docs/releases/v1.1.2-qualification.md":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -26,3 +26,3 @@\n | WP-1102 — Flight recorder credential redaction | Zero-leak sanitization across traces, CLI errors, and debug journals. | Commit `ee7c8b1e` contains partial redaction work; operator acceptance remains pending. | **OPEN** | Full sink coverage, adversarial/credential fixtures, operator acceptance, and exact-head review. |\n-| WP-1103 — Versioned evaluation datasets | Versioned datasets with separate examples/oracles and regression/benchmark splits; candidate prompts cannot access oracles. | Candidate source tree `ac52532540209a39e2aad86af84a16ba375dd770`, based on `a0d374e8`, passed the serialized complete CLI suite: 2,251 total, 2,246 passed, 0 failed, 5 skipped; process-scope fixtures passed. Log SHA-256 `bae2a5b6c3472ab2dbcbb446867adc2c0a2ddc6fe2e25b7753e3be340fa85cb0`. The focused evaluator suite also passed 91/91 (log SHA-256 `5ecdd84e573c2c6ee0c7cda6c038b6a4043ad002ec7a004cceaef3dceb67320e`). TypeScript and Rust release builds passed on the identical source tree. | **IMPLEMENTATION / GATE PASS; REVIEW PENDING** | Independent review of this exact-base candidate; finish manifest-pinned six-task installed CLI acceptance and record evidence; commit and rerun required gates on exact commit. |\n+| WP-1103 — Versioned evaluation datasets | Versioned datasets with separate examples/oracles and regression/benchmark splits; candidate prompts cannot access oracles. | Candidate is based on `a0d374e8`. The serialized complete CLI suite passed: 2,251 total, 2,246 passed, 0 failed, 5 skipped; process-scope fixtures passed. Log SHA-256 `bae2a5b6c3472ab2dbcbb446867adc2c0a2ddc6fe2e25b7753e3be340fa85cb0`. The focused evaluator suite passed 91/91 (log SHA-256 `5ecdd84e573c2c6ee0c7cda6c038b6a4043ad002ec7a004cceaef3dceb67320e`). TypeScript and Rust release builds passed. A pinned Bookworm package built from this candidate passed six-task installed acceptance, archive SHA-256 `27dbbb8120e755061e92218eaceb5e12b7d9457230b9b0aa82b96d28cc3791ee`; evidence is `acceptance-27dbbb8120e7.json`. The full suite's six-task acceptance was skipped because its package/evidence variables were unset; that run is not the acceptance proof. The reviewer identified a nested-mount detection gap in AC2; the probe now matches dataset roots and descendants, and the focused AC2 test passed 3/3 after the fix. | **SOURCE TEST GATE PASS; INSTALLED ACCEPTANCE PASS; FINAL REVIEW PENDING** | Obtain fresh independent review of the AC2 test fix and evidence; commit, bind the package to that exact commit, and rerun required gates on the exact commit. |\n | WP-1104 — Standalone `nexus eval` | Packaged command supports dataset selection, run count, isolated home, and structured score output. | Source commits `05c49df2` and `2a94f62e` were reviewed; `npm run build` passed. Focused six-task installed-candidate acceptance is recorded in `WP-1104-PLAN.md`, but it is not final integrated-candidate qualification. | **SOURCE SLICE CLOSED / RELEASE GATE OPEN** | Re-run applicable checks on the final integrated candidate; prove package parity and installed CLI operation without developer dependencies; fresh independent review. |\n@@ -38,3 +38,3 @@\n | G1.1-1 — Zero-leak tracing | Valid OTel GenAI spans for all required turn steps, no credential leakage, and writes confined to the approved trace directory. | WP-1101 prototype lacks runtime wiring and gate evidence. | **OPEN** |\n-| G1.1-2 — Dataset decoupling | All benchmark tasks execute and no oracle data reaches candidate prompts; exact candidate and process-scope evidence retained. | Candidate source tree `ac52532540209a39e2aad86af84a16ba375dd770` passed the complete suite and process-scope postcheck; focused evaluator suite passed 91/91. The six-task installed CLI acceptance with recomputed manifest digest is still pending. | **PARTIAL / UNQUALIFIED** |\n+| G1.1-2 — Dataset decoupling | All benchmark tasks execute and no oracle data reaches candidate prompts; exact candidate and process-scope evidence retained. | Complete suite and process-scope postcheck passed; focused evaluator suite passed 91/91; the AC2 nested-mount probe passed 3/3; and the pinned Bookworm package passed six-task installed acceptance with recomputed manifest SHA-256 `05ee2fa33ae5f6d6afc35df2e003c913de3f7bf0f817d2f76c709c16fb640d43`. Acceptance archive SHA-256 `27dbbb8120e755061e92218eaceb5e12b7d9457230b9b0aa82b96d28cc3791ee`. The archive was built before commit and lacks final commit binding; reviewer follow-up is pending. | **PARTIAL / UNQUALIFIED** |\n | G1.1-3 — CLI parity | Packaged `nexus eval` works without developer dependencies on the exact release candidate. | Focused installed-candidate evidence exists; final integrated candidate is unverified. | **PARTIAL / UNQUALIFIED** |\n","move_path":null}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM /home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-integrated-exact/docs/releases/v1.1.2-qualification.md\n","stderr":""},"started_at_ms":1793660403819,"completed_at_ms":1793660403820}}
