t, bind the package to that exact commit, and rerun required gates on the exact commit. |\n+| WP-1103 — Versioned evaluation datasets | Versioned datasets with separate examples/oracles and regression/benchmark splits; candidate prompts cannot access oracles. | Candidate is based on `a0d374e8`. The serialized complete CLI suite passed: 2,251 total, 2,246 passed, 0 failed, 5 skipped; process-scope fixtures passed. Log SHA-256 `bae2a5b6c3472ab2dbcbb446867adc2c0a2ddc6fe2e25b7753e3be340fa85cb0`. The focused evaluator suite passed 91/91 (log SHA-256 `5ecdd84e573c2c6ee0c7cda6c038b6a4043ad002ec7a004cceaef3dceb67320e`). TypeScript and Rust release builds passed. A pinned Bookworm package built from this candidate passed six-task installed acceptance, archive SHA-256 `27dbbb8120e755061e92218eaceb5e12b7d9457230b9b0aa82b96d28cc3791ee`; evidence is `acceptance-27dbbb8120e7.json`. Earlier evidence for archive `b385cd533f9e…` is historical and is not proof for this candidate. The full suite's six-task acceptance was skipped because its package/evidence variables were unset; that run is not the acceptance proof. The reviewer identified a nested-mount detection gap in AC2; the probe now matches dataset roots and descendants, and the focused AC2 test passed 3/3 after the fix. | **SOURCE TEST GATE PASS; INSTALLED ACCEPTANCE PASS; FINAL REVIEW PENDING** | Obtain fresh independent review of the AC2 test fix and evidence; commit, bind the package to that exact commit, and rerun required gates on the exact commit. |\n | WP-1104 — Standalone `nexus eval` | Packaged command supports dataset selection, run count, isolated home, and structured score output. | Source commits `05c49df2` and `2a94f62e` were reviewed; `npm run build` passed. Focused six-task installed-candidate acceptance is recorded in `WP-1104-PLAN.md`, but it is not final integrated-candidate qualification. | **SOURCE SLICE CLOSED / RELEASE GATE OPEN** | Re-run applicable checks on the final integrated candidate; prove package parity and installed CLI operation without developer dependencies; fresh independent review. |\n","move_path":null}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM /home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-integrated-exact/docs/releases/v1.1.2-qualification.md\n","stderr":""},"started_at_ms":1793660422601,"completed_at_ms":1793660422603}}
