{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T23:01:02.925Z","ordinal":49581,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a19e7e-a74d-7e02-beca-76ece57cae3c","author":"/root/review_delta","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/review_delta\nPayload:\n**Source diff: APPROVED.** The mount probe now detects mounts rooted at the dataset or any descendant, closing the reported coverage gap.\n\n**Qualification: still partial / unqualified.** The new artifact records all six task runs with no missing or skipped IDs. The document correctly notes that the full-suite acceptance was skipped and that the artifact predates the final commit. This supports installed execution coverage, not final exact-candidate qualification. I did not run tests."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a19de1-2f43-7663-a2d9-f17adf8cb101","create_time":1793660462.925235,"content_item_metadata":[{"provenance":{"type":"tool","namespace":"collaboration"}}]}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":2048}}
