{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T23:01:05.337Z","ordinal":49584,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a192c0-f277-7f60-8574-21ce71edb8c2","turn_id":"01a19de1-2f43-7663-a2d9-f17adf8cb101","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0fd4138577b17921016ae91630c16881a3b93805a288d02fa9","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Peer review approved the AC2 test fix. The qualification ledger now correctly limits the claim: six-task installed execution passed, while final release qualification remains open until the candidate is committed and requalified on that exact commit. I’m doing the integration closeout for this slice next."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793660464778,"completed_at_ms":1793660465337}}
{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T23:01:05.341Z","ordinal":49585,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","status":"completed","id":"msg_0fd4138577b17921016ae91630c16881a3b93805a288d02fa9","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"Peer review approved the AC2 test fix. The qualification ledger now correctly limits the claim: six-task installed execution passed, while final release qualification remains open until the candidate is committed and requalified on that exact commit. I’m doing the integration closeout for this slice next.","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a19de1-2f43-7663-a2d9-f17adf8cb101","create_time":1793660464.7606094,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_0fd4138577b17921016ae91630c16881a3b93805a288d02fa9","turn_id":"01a19de1-2f43-7663-a2d9-f17adf8cb101","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a19e7e-b0bc-7f81-8fcf-4d9a7fac8ca0","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":2049}}
{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T23:01:09.874Z","ordinal":49586,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0fd4138577b17921016ae91631513081a39a0c07f605461f94","status":"completed","call_id":"call_5525ca3663734b6ea0afe0b163cd7a0e","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /home/mike/nexus-wt/v112-integrated-exact/docs/releases/v1.1.2-qualification.md\\n@@\\n-| WP-1103 — Versioned evaluation datasets | Versioned datasets with separate examples/oracles and regression/benchmark splits; candidate prompts cannot access oracles. | Candidate is based on `a0d374e8`. The serialized complete CLI suite passed: 2,251 total, 2,246 passed, 0 failed, 5 skipped; process-scope fixtures passed. Log SHA-256 `bae2a5b6c3472ab2dbcbb446867adc2c0a2ddc6fe2e25b7753e3be340fa85cb0`. The focused evaluator suite passed 91/91 (log SHA-256 `5ecdd84e573c2c6ee0c7cda6c038b6a4043ad002ec7a004cceaef3dceb67320e`). TypeScript and Rust release builds passed. A pinned Bookworm package built from this candidate passed six-task installed acceptance, archive SHA-256 `27dbbb8120e755061e92218eaceb5e12b7d9457230b9b0aa82b96d28cc3791ee`; evidence is `acceptance-27dbbb8120e7.json`. Earlier evidence for archive `b385cd533f9e…` is historical and is not proof for this candidate. The full suite's six-task acceptance was skipped because its package/evidence variables were unset; that run is not the acceptance proof. The reviewer identified a nested-mount detection gap in AC2; the probe now matches dataset roots and descendants, and the focused AC2 test passed 3/3 after the fix. | **SOURCE TEST GATE PASS; INSTALLED ACCEPTANCE PASS; FINAL REVIEW PENDING** | Obtain fresh independent review of the AC2 test fix and evidence; commit, bind the package to that exact commit, and rerun required gates on the exact commit. |\\n+| WP-1103 — Versioned evaluation datasets | Versioned datasets with separate examples/oracles and regression/benchmark splits; candidate prompts cannot access oracles. | Candidate is based on `a0d374e8`. The serialized complete CLI suite passed: 2,251 total, 2,246 passed, 0 failed, 5 skipped; process-scope fixtures passed. Log SHA-256 `bae2a5b6c3472ab2dbcbb446867adc2c0a2ddc6fe2e25b7753e3be340fa85cb0`. The focused evaluator suite passed 91/91 (log SHA-256 `5ecdd84e573c2c6ee0c7cda6c038b6a4043ad002ec7a004cceaef3dceb67320e`). TypeScript and Rust release builds passed. A pinned Bookworm package built from this candidate passed six-task installed acceptance, archive SHA-256 `27dbbb8120e755061e92218eaceb5e12b7d9457230b9b0aa82b96d28cc3791ee`; evidence is `acceptance-27dbbb8120e7.json`. Earlier evidence for archive `b385cd533f9e…` is historical and is not proof for this candidate. The full suite's six-task acceptance was skipped because its package/evidence variables were unset; that run is not the acceptance proof. The reviewer identified a nested-mount detection gap in AC2; the probe now matches dataset roots and descendants, and the focused AC2 test passed 3/3 after the fix. Independent review approved the updated source diff; commit-bound evidence is still pending. | **SOURCE REVIEW APPROVED; COMMIT-BOUND GATE OPEN** | Commit, bind the package to that exact commit, and rerun required gates on the exact commit. |\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a19de1-2f43-7663-a2d9-f17adf8cb101","create_time":1793660465.3191411}}}
